  "description": "A powerful, fluent C# library that converts lambda expressions to SQL queries with support for multiple database dialects. Features include type-safe query building, Column selection, WhereIn with collections, expression-based Set operations, CTEs, Window Functions, and advanced SQL generation.",
  "id": "LambdifySQL",
  "isPrerelease": false,
