  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "LambdifySQL v2.0.0 - Major Release\n\n      NEW FEATURES:\n      - Upgraded to .NET 8.0 with C# 12 support\n      - Column<T>() method for selective column projection\n      - WhereIn() overload accepting collections (IEnumerable<T>)\n      - Set() overload supporting expressions (e.g., Set(p => p.Price, p => p.Price * 1.1m))\n      - Enhanced OrWhere support across all query builders\n      - Improved type safety and nullable reference type support\n\n      IMPROVEMENTS:\n      - Better parameter handling and SQL injection prevention\n      - Enhanced expression tree conversion\n      - Support for complex lambda expressions\n      - Improved fluent API consistency\n      - Better error handling and validation\n\n      DIALECTS SUPPORTED:\n      - Microsoft SQL Server\n      - MySQL\n      - PostgreSQL\n      - SQLite\n\n      BREAKING CHANGES:\n      - Minimum .NET version is now 8.0\n      - Namespace changed from LambdaToSQL to LambdifySQL\n      - Some method signatures updated for better type safety",
